{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/ArmyInsignias.png?t=1741273040\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/ArmyInsignias__2_.png?t=1741273040\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/ArmyInsignias__3_.png?t=1741273040\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/ArmyInsignias__4_.png?t=1741273040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Plan Your Attack</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Rogue Conflict </i>introduces players to several army factions, each containing various unit types. From infantry units to armored tanks, each faction features its own playstyle. Depending on the map\u2019s terrain and enemy types, players must select their offensive units and plan their attacks accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Turn-Based Tactics</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy your units in strategic formations that anticipate your opponent\u2019s next move. Use artillery, tanks, aircraft, infantry, and more in the game\u2019s turn-based battles. As your opponent\u2019s offensive front grows stronger, strong weaponry and strategic deployment are crucial to your success. Deplete your enemy\u2019s morale and strength to zero and claim each map\u2019s objectives to succeed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Roguelike Features</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Rogue Conflict\u2019</i>s<i> </i>procedurally-generated elements challenge players on grid-based maps. Plan your attacks based on the surrounding terrain, available units, and the enemy\u2019s position. If you\u2019re overcome in battle, you lose the progress made during your offensive and should restrategize for the next encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Customize Your Army</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you complete different missions, use your rewards to request stronger reinforcements and purchase unit upgrades to strengthen your attacks. <i>Rogue Conflict\u2019</i>s Reinforcement Points (RP) are rewarded for your wins and can be exchanged for enemy intelligence reports, unit upgrades, and additional boons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Key Features</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 15 different armies to coordinate your most effective plan of attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomized map combinations challenge players' combat skills on land and in the air.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game\u2019s upgrade system offers boons to weapons, reinforcement types, and large battle equipment such as tanks and aircraft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run campaigns from a commander\u2019s perspective, managing complete control over your army\u2019s every move in battle.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916010/extras/Gif.gif?t=1741273040\" /></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2916010/ad3b820aab3e688f40b3bf2979a1e1ba6c0e3e7b.jpg"},{"name":"Glory to the Kingdom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2916010/0c0e22c43e6441687b8d97b7ea7bc649e9f1dfd4.jpg"},{"name":"Combined Arms Warfare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2916010/23d57d27e421f8d835aadb7eeebd8cdccb855f5d.jpg"},{"name":"Lightning Attack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2916010/5183b4c5558d0377e5f689a9d46a1a8e5519ffda.jpg"},{"name":"Great Victory","pat